/T (In recent years, the global functional food and nutraceutical market has shown rapid growth, driven by consumer demand for natural, affordable, and preventive health solutions \(Swanson et al., 2020\). Traditional beverages like Kanji represent a valuable but underutilized resource within this context, offering both cultural heritage and scientific potential. )
/E (In recent years, the global functional food and nutraceutical market has shown rapid growth, driven by consumer demand for natural, affordable, and preventive health solutions \(Swanson et al., 2020\). Traditional beverages like Kanji represent a valuable but underutilized resource within this context, offering both cultural heritage and scientific potential. )
